---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Journal
description: "Session recaps, GM advice, and behind-the-scenes updates from Dad Knows Dungeons."
permalink: /journal/{% if pagination.pageNumber > 0 %}page/{{ pagination.pageNumber + 1 }}/{% endif %}
pagination:
  data: collections.journal
  size: 6
  alias: posts
  reverse: false
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="hero__eyebrow">Session logs &amp; GM advice</p>
    <h1>Journal</h1>
    <p class="hero__lede mb-lg">Campaign recaps, Game Master tips, and the occasional "here's what we'd do differently" post-mortem.</p>

    <div class="search-bar">
      <label class="visually-hidden" for="journal-search">Search the journal</label>
      <input class="search-bar__input" id="journal-search" type="search" placeholder="Search titles and tags…" data-journal-search>
    </div>

    {% if collections.tagList.length %}
    <ul class="tag-pills mb-lg">
      <li><a class="tag-pill tag-pill--active" href="/journal/">All</a></li>
      {% for tag in collections.tagList %}
      <li><a class="tag-pill" href="/journal/tags/{{ tag | slugify }}/">{{ tag }}</a></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="grid grid--3" data-journal-grid>
      {% for post in posts %}
      <div data-journal-item data-title="{{ post.data.title | lower }}" data-tags="{{ post.data.tags | join(' ') | lower }}">
        {% include "partials/journal-card.njk" %}
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <nav class="pagination" aria-label="Journal pagination">
      {% if pagination.href.previous %}<a class="pagination__link" href="{{ pagination.href.previous }}">&larr; Newer</a>{% else %}<span></span>{% endif %}
      {% if pagination.href.next %}<a class="pagination__link" href="{{ pagination.href.next }}">Older &rarr;</a>{% endif %}
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>
